  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Laplace’s Demon — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>At 6th level, you have learned to overload the minds of others instead of your own. As an action for 4 cursed energy you can touch a creature and force them to make an Intelligence saving throw. On a failure they take 5d10 psychic damage and are stunned until the end of their next turn, on a success they take half as much damage and aren’t stunned.</p>",
